        MCP["MCP server endpoints<br/>(Resources + Tools, primary)"]
        Webhook["Webhooks<br/>(notify-only, secondary)"]
    end

    Identity["HumanPrincipalBinding<br/>(IdentityProvider, D-IMPL-21)"]
    Replay["Decision Replay record<br/>(dimension 2 extension)"]

    Gate --> ApprovalGate
    DcBreach --> ExceptionEscalation
    AgentOut --> OverrideBoundary
    AgentOut --> ReviewQueue

    ApprovalGate --> Queue
    ExceptionEscalation --> Queue
    OverrideBoundary --> Queue
    ReviewQueue --> Queue
    Queue --> MCP
    Queue -.notify only.-> Webhook
    Webhook -.action returns via queue.-> Queue
    Identity --> Queue

    ApprovalGate ==audit by construction==> Replay
